[
  {
    "start": "00:00:04.268",
    "end": "00:00:07.171",
    "start_seconds": 4.268,
    "end_seconds": 7.171,
    "text": "On Valentine's Day 2022,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:07.204",
    "end": "00:00:12.043",
    "start_seconds": 7.204,
    "end_seconds": 12.043,
    "text": "a pontoon bridge appeared near the border of Belarus and Ukraine."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:12.743",
    "end": "00:00:15.713",
    "start_seconds": 12.743,
    "end_seconds": 15.713,
    "text": "One day, an empty river,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:15.746",
    "end": "00:00:18.416",
    "start_seconds": 15.746,
    "end_seconds": 18.416,
    "text": "and the next day, a bridge."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:19.083",
    "end": "00:00:22.386",
    "start_seconds": 19.083,
    "end_seconds": 22.386,
    "text": "I’m the cofounder of an Earth imaging company,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:22.420",
    "end": "00:00:23.587",
    "start_seconds": 22.42,
    "end_seconds": 23.587,
    "text": "and with our satellites,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:23.587",
    "end": "00:00:26.657",
    "start_seconds": 23.587,
    "end_seconds": 26.657,
    "text": "we can see the entire world every day."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:27.191",
    "end": "00:00:30.261",
    "start_seconds": 27.191,
    "end_seconds": 30.261,
    "text": "And from space, we were able to detect that bridge,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:30.261",
    "end": "00:00:31.462",
    "start_seconds": 30.261,
    "end_seconds": 31.462,
    "text": "zoom in,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:31.495",
    "end": "00:00:35.566",
    "start_seconds": 31.495,
    "end_seconds": 35.566,
    "text": "and that picture was broadcast around the world the next morning."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:35.966",
    "end": "00:00:39.537",
    "start_seconds": 35.966,
    "end_seconds": 39.537,
    "text": "Everyone could see that something was changing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:41.105",
    "end": "00:00:44.542",
    "start_seconds": 41.105,
    "end_seconds": 44.542,
    "text": "And then ten days later, Russia invaded Ukraine."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:45.176",
    "end": "00:00:49.480",
    "start_seconds": 45.176,
    "end_seconds": 49.48,
    "text": "Thanks to satellite imagery, many governments and NGOs,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:49.513",
    "end": "00:00:51.582",
    "start_seconds": 49.513,
    "end_seconds": 51.582,
    "text": "researchers and journalists,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:51.615",
    "end": "00:00:55.519",
    "start_seconds": 51.615,
    "end_seconds": 55.519,
    "text": "they all had access to the same daily facts,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:55.553",
    "end": "00:00:57.988",
    "start_seconds": 55.553,
    "end_seconds": 57.988,
    "text": "the same baseline of reality,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:58.022",
    "end": "00:01:01.192",
    "start_seconds": 58.022,
    "end_seconds": 61.192,
    "text": "and the same possibility, at least in theory,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:01.225",
    "end": "00:01:03.828",
    "start_seconds": 61.225,
    "end_seconds": 63.828,
    "text": "of seeing clearly enough to respond together."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:04.395",
    "end": "00:01:06.230",
    "start_seconds": 64.395,
    "end_seconds": 66.23,
    "text": "And with that shared view of reality,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:06.263",
    "end": "00:01:09.400",
    "start_seconds": 66.263,
    "end_seconds": 69.4,
    "text": "we’re no longer arguing if something is there"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:09.433",
    "end": "00:01:12.303",
    "start_seconds": 69.43299999999999,
    "end_seconds": 72.303,
    "text": "but deciding what to do because it is there."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:12.837",
    "end": "00:01:16.040",
    "start_seconds": 72.837,
    "end_seconds": 76.03999999999999,
    "text": "In the days that followed that Valentine's Day bridge,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:16.073",
    "end": "00:01:20.144",
    "start_seconds": 76.07300000000001,
    "end_seconds": 80.144,
    "text": "Western nations coordinated for severe sanctions against Russia"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:20.177",
    "end": "00:01:22.413",
    "start_seconds": 80.17699999999999,
    "end_seconds": 82.413,
    "text": "and unified in their support for Ukraine."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:22.880",
    "end": "00:01:24.682",
    "start_seconds": 82.88,
    "end_seconds": 84.682,
    "text": "But for months beforehand,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:24.715",
    "end": "00:01:27.418",
    "start_seconds": 84.715,
    "end_seconds": 87.418,
    "text": "we saw an increase of military activity"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:27.451",
    "end": "00:01:29.653",
    "start_seconds": 87.451,
    "end_seconds": 89.65299999999999,
    "text": "and tanks amassing at the border."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:30.354",
    "end": "00:01:32.389",
    "start_seconds": 90.354,
    "end_seconds": 92.38900000000001,
    "text": "The signals were there."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:33.324",
    "end": "00:01:36.994",
    "start_seconds": 93.324,
    "end_seconds": 96.994,
    "text": "Perhaps the allies stopped the worst from happening,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:37.027",
    "end": "00:01:38.629",
    "start_seconds": 97.027,
    "end_seconds": 98.62899999999999,
    "text": "but they didn't stop the war."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:40.397",
    "end": "00:01:43.067",
    "start_seconds": 100.39699999999999,
    "end_seconds": 103.06700000000001,
    "text": "And I sat with that for a really long time."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:44.335",
    "end": "00:01:47.872",
    "start_seconds": 104.33500000000001,
    "end_seconds": 107.872,
    "text": "The satellites, they worked exactly as they were designed."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:47.872",
    "end": "00:01:49.440",
    "start_seconds": 107.872,
    "end_seconds": 109.44,
    "text": "They showed the emerging threat."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:49.473",
    "end": "00:01:51.008",
    "start_seconds": 109.473,
    "end_seconds": 111.00800000000001,
    "text": "They saw the threat."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:51.575",
    "end": "00:01:54.845",
    "start_seconds": 111.575,
    "end_seconds": 114.845,
    "text": "But the institutions that were supposed to respond,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:54.879",
    "end": "00:01:56.514",
    "start_seconds": 114.87899999999999,
    "end_seconds": 116.51400000000001,
    "text": "they weren't built for this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:57.381",
    "end": "00:02:00.885",
    "start_seconds": 117.381,
    "end_seconds": 120.885,
    "text": "The alliances, the frameworks, the coordination mechanisms,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:00.918",
    "end": "00:02:03.888",
    "start_seconds": 120.918,
    "end_seconds": 123.888,
    "text": "they weren't built to handle signal at this speed"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:03.921",
    "end": "00:02:06.223",
    "start_seconds": 123.921,
    "end_seconds": 126.223,
    "text": "or to incorporate this amount of information."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:06.657",
    "end": "00:02:10.427",
    "start_seconds": 126.657,
    "end_seconds": 130.427,
    "text": "And we built this extraordinary eye,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:10.461",
    "end": "00:02:14.165",
    "start_seconds": 130.461,
    "end_seconds": 134.165,
    "text": "an independent source of truth about what's happening on the planet."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:14.665",
    "end": "00:02:18.969",
    "start_seconds": 134.665,
    "end_seconds": 138.969,
    "text": "But an eye that's not connected to a functional nervous system"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:19.003",
    "end": "00:02:22.173",
    "start_seconds": 139.003,
    "end_seconds": 142.173,
    "text": "and a body capable of response,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:22.206",
    "end": "00:02:24.008",
    "start_seconds": 142.206,
    "end_seconds": 144.008,
    "text": "that eye is just a witness."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:24.608",
    "end": "00:02:28.512",
    "start_seconds": 144.608,
    "end_seconds": 148.512,
    "text": "But fortunately, new technologies are helping to close that gap."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:28.546",
    "end": "00:02:31.415",
    "start_seconds": 148.546,
    "end_seconds": 151.415,
    "text": "When you take all of this earth data"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:31.415",
    "end": "00:02:35.152",
    "start_seconds": 151.415,
    "end_seconds": 155.152,
    "text": "and pair it with the analytical power of AI,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:35.152",
    "end": "00:02:38.722",
    "start_seconds": 155.152,
    "end_seconds": 158.722,
    "text": "we can build extremely different things,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:38.756",
    "end": "00:02:41.825",
    "start_seconds": 158.756,
    "end_seconds": 161.825,
    "text": "action in an entirely new way."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:42.426",
    "end": "00:02:46.197",
    "start_seconds": 162.426,
    "end_seconds": 166.197,
    "text": "We're entering into an era that we call planetary intelligence,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:46.230",
    "end": "00:02:49.833",
    "start_seconds": 166.23,
    "end_seconds": 169.833,
    "text": "where new capabilities in action can happen at the speed of change."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:50.334",
    "end": "00:02:54.338",
    "start_seconds": 170.334,
    "end_seconds": 174.338,
    "text": "Now, my cofounder, Will, was on this spot in 2014,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:54.338",
    "end": "00:02:56.307",
    "start_seconds": 174.338,
    "end_seconds": 176.30700000000002,
    "text": "and he shared with you all our dream."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:56.807",
    "end": "00:03:00.211",
    "start_seconds": 176.80700000000002,
    "end_seconds": 180.211,
    "text": "What if we could image the whole world every day?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:01.212",
    "end": "00:03:04.381",
    "start_seconds": 181.212,
    "end_seconds": 184.381,
    "text": "And he came back in 2018 with a new dream."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:04.415",
    "end": "00:03:08.018",
    "start_seconds": 184.415,
    "end_seconds": 188.018,
    "text": "What if we can use AI to understand how the world is changing?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:09.086",
    "end": "00:03:12.323",
    "start_seconds": 189.086,
    "end_seconds": 192.323,
    "text": "And today, that vision is becoming a reality."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:12.890",
    "end": "00:03:14.758",
    "start_seconds": 192.89,
    "end_seconds": 194.758,
    "text": "And before I share that with you today,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:14.758",
    "end": "00:03:16.894",
    "start_seconds": 194.758,
    "end_seconds": 196.894,
    "text": "I want to provide a little bit of context."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:17.461",
    "end": "00:03:20.364",
    "start_seconds": 197.461,
    "end_seconds": 200.364,
    "text": "The space sector is going through a renaissance right now."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:20.397",
    "end": "00:03:23.667",
    "start_seconds": 200.397,
    "end_seconds": 203.667,
    "text": "We have reusable rockets, thousands of satellites."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:24.235",
    "end": "00:03:28.005",
    "start_seconds": 204.235,
    "end_seconds": 208.005,
    "text": "And for the first time in over 50 years,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:28.038",
    "end": "00:03:30.174",
    "start_seconds": 208.038,
    "end_seconds": 210.174,
    "text": "we just sent humans to the moon and back."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30.574",
    "end": "00:03:34.044",
    "start_seconds": 210.574,
    "end_seconds": 214.04399999999998,
    "text": "NASA is inspiring us once again with this picture"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:34.044",
    "end": "00:03:36.914",
    "start_seconds": 214.04399999999998,
    "end_seconds": 216.914,
    "text": "to gain perspective that we live on this beautiful,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:36.947",
    "end": "00:03:39.617",
    "start_seconds": 216.947,
    "end_seconds": 219.617,
    "text": "precious spaceship Earth that we call home."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:40.417",
    "end": "00:03:44.054",
    "start_seconds": 220.417,
    "end_seconds": 224.054,
    "text": "And with hundreds of satellites that are all monitoring the planet,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.054",
    "end": "00:03:46.123",
    "start_seconds": 224.054,
    "end_seconds": 226.123,
    "text": "they're getting connected to each other,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:46.156",
    "end": "00:03:48.659",
    "start_seconds": 226.156,
    "end_seconds": 228.659,
    "text": "and we're putting a lot more compute next to it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:48.659",
    "end": "00:03:51.595",
    "start_seconds": 228.659,
    "end_seconds": 231.595,
    "text": "It's beginning to build a planetary nervous system."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:52.963",
    "end": "00:03:54.565",
    "start_seconds": 232.963,
    "end_seconds": 234.565,
    "text": "And here on the ground,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:54.565",
    "end": "00:03:59.570",
    "start_seconds": 234.565,
    "end_seconds": 239.57,
    "text": "we're all in amazement as AI just continues to accelerate at rapid speed."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:00.404",
    "end": "00:04:02.039",
    "start_seconds": 240.404,
    "end_seconds": 242.039,
    "text": "And like many of you here,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:02.072",
    "end": "00:04:04.408",
    "start_seconds": 242.072,
    "end_seconds": 244.408,
    "text": "I'm holding on to that polarity"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:04.441",
    "end": "00:04:07.611",
    "start_seconds": 244.441,
    "end_seconds": 247.611,
    "text": "between the sheer awesomeness of this technology,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:07.645",
    "end": "00:04:09.313",
    "start_seconds": 247.645,
    "end_seconds": 249.313,
    "text": "and also a bit of anxiety"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:09.313",
    "end": "00:04:12.016",
    "start_seconds": 249.313,
    "end_seconds": 252.016,
    "text": "about how this comes into the world in the right way."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:12.650",
    "end": "00:04:15.486",
    "start_seconds": 252.65,
    "end_seconds": 255.486,
    "text": "We have to get governance right,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:15.486",
    "end": "00:04:17.488",
    "start_seconds": 255.486,
    "end_seconds": 257.488,
    "text": "and we have to get alignment right."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:17.821",
    "end": "00:04:20.658",
    "start_seconds": 257.821,
    "end_seconds": 260.658,
    "text": "For AI to work for everyone"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:20.691",
    "end": "00:04:23.527",
    "start_seconds": 260.691,
    "end_seconds": 263.527,
    "text": "and the larger living world,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:23.527",
    "end": "00:04:26.697",
    "start_seconds": 263.527,
    "end_seconds": 266.697,
    "text": "we need it to speak the language of the planetary systems"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:26.697",
    "end": "00:04:28.299",
    "start_seconds": 266.697,
    "end_seconds": 268.299,
    "text": "to which we're all embedded."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:28.666",
    "end": "00:04:33.003",
    "start_seconds": 268.666,
    "end_seconds": 273.003,
    "text": "It must understand our infrastructure and human activity,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:33.037",
    "end": "00:04:39.143",
    "start_seconds": 273.037,
    "end_seconds": 279.14300000000003,
    "text": "but also the impacts on the water, the trees and the soil."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:39.777",
    "end": "00:04:42.079",
    "start_seconds": 279.777,
    "end_seconds": 282.079,
    "text": "So let me show you what this looks like."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:43.013",
    "end": "00:04:46.283",
    "start_seconds": 283.013,
    "end_seconds": 286.283,
    "text": "So when you combine all of this Earth data"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:46.317",
    "end": "00:04:49.086",
    "start_seconds": 286.317,
    "end_seconds": 289.086,
    "text": "with AI and large language models,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:49.119",
    "end": "00:04:53.424",
    "start_seconds": 289.119,
    "end_seconds": 293.424,
    "text": "we are allowing for global change to happen in near real time."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:53.457",
    "end": "00:04:55.726",
    "start_seconds": 293.457,
    "end_seconds": 295.726,
    "text": "You can see change in just about everywhere"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:55.759",
    "end": "00:04:58.529",
    "start_seconds": 295.759,
    "end_seconds": 298.529,
    "text": "over vast distances and time."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:59.263",
    "end": "00:05:03.901",
    "start_seconds": 299.263,
    "end_seconds": 303.901,
    "text": "It's helping to close that gap between awareness and action."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:04.268",
    "end": "00:05:07.938",
    "start_seconds": 304.268,
    "end_seconds": 307.938,
    "text": "A farmer can understand how healthy their soil is."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:08.238",
    "end": "00:05:11.909",
    "start_seconds": 308.238,
    "end_seconds": 311.909,
    "text": "An insurer can create a dynamic and custom policy"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:11.909",
    "end": "00:05:15.346",
    "start_seconds": 311.909,
    "end_seconds": 315.346,
    "text": "based on the real-time environmental risk of the asset."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:15.346",
    "end": "00:05:17.114",
    "start_seconds": 315.346,
    "end_seconds": 317.114,
    "text": "And a finance minister,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:17.147",
    "end": "00:05:21.552",
    "start_seconds": 317.147,
    "end_seconds": 321.552,
    "text": "they can account for the true cost of their financial economy"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:21.585",
    "end": "00:05:25.055",
    "start_seconds": 321.585,
    "end_seconds": 325.055,
    "text": "along with their rich, living, natural ecosystems."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:25.422",
    "end": "00:05:29.460",
    "start_seconds": 325.422,
    "end_seconds": 329.46,
    "text": "So planetary intelligence guides our actions"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:29.460",
    "end": "00:05:30.694",
    "start_seconds": 329.46,
    "end_seconds": 330.694,
    "text": "much in the same way"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:30.728",
    "end": "00:05:34.898",
    "start_seconds": 330.728,
    "end_seconds": 334.898,
    "text": "that the eye connected to a nervous system guides the body"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:34.932",
    "end": "00:05:39.436",
    "start_seconds": 334.932,
    "end_seconds": 339.436,
    "text": "so that humanity is no longer a witness to what's happening."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:39.470",
    "end": "00:05:43.440",
    "start_seconds": 339.47,
    "end_seconds": 343.44,
    "text": "We can become stewards for the planet and our society."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:44.041",
    "end": "00:05:46.844",
    "start_seconds": 344.041,
    "end_seconds": 346.844,
    "text": "And we're already seeing glimmers of planetary intelligence"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:46.877",
    "end": "00:05:48.679",
    "start_seconds": 346.877,
    "end_seconds": 348.679,
    "text": "happening all over the world."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:48.712",
    "end": "00:05:51.849",
    "start_seconds": 348.712,
    "end_seconds": 351.849,
    "text": "It is already measuring global change in near real time,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:51.882",
    "end": "00:05:55.219",
    "start_seconds": 351.882,
    "end_seconds": 355.219,
    "text": "guiding human intervention where it's needed the most."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:55.252",
    "end": "00:05:57.054",
    "start_seconds": 355.252,
    "end_seconds": 357.054,
    "text": "So let me show you a few examples."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:57.087",
    "end": "00:05:58.889",
    "start_seconds": 357.087,
    "end_seconds": 358.889,
    "text": "First, let's go to Brazil."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:58.922",
    "end": "00:06:01.658",
    "start_seconds": 358.922,
    "end_seconds": 361.658,
    "text": "The Brazilian Amazon is huge."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:01.692",
    "end": "00:06:03.527",
    "start_seconds": 361.692,
    "end_seconds": 363.527,
    "text": "It's five million square kilometers,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:03.560",
    "end": "00:06:06.530",
    "start_seconds": 363.56,
    "end_seconds": 366.53,
    "text": "roughly two thirds the size of the United States,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:06.530",
    "end": "00:06:09.633",
    "start_seconds": 366.53,
    "end_seconds": 369.633,
    "text": "and it's brimming with rich biodiversity,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:09.666",
    "end": "00:06:12.136",
    "start_seconds": 369.666,
    "end_seconds": 372.136,
    "text": "countless Indigenous communities."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:12.169",
    "end": "00:06:16.707",
    "start_seconds": 372.169,
    "end_seconds": 376.707,
    "text": "And it's the home of about 20 percent of the planet's freshwater supply."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:17.608",
    "end": "00:06:20.544",
    "start_seconds": 377.608,
    "end_seconds": 380.544,
    "text": "But deep in the dense forests of the Amazon,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:20.577",
    "end": "00:06:24.114",
    "start_seconds": 380.577,
    "end_seconds": 384.114,
    "text": "there are illegal activities that are happening all the time."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:24.148",
    "end": "00:06:27.551",
    "start_seconds": 384.148,
    "end_seconds": 387.551,
    "text": "Fields are cleared for illicit crops."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:27.584",
    "end": "00:06:30.254",
    "start_seconds": 387.584,
    "end_seconds": 390.254,
    "text": "Runways are cut for narco traffickers."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:30.754",
    "end": "00:06:34.758",
    "start_seconds": 390.754,
    "end_seconds": 394.758,
    "text": "Riverbeds are illegally mined and poisoning downstream communities."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:34.792",
    "end": "00:06:37.594",
    "start_seconds": 394.79200000000003,
    "end_seconds": 397.594,
    "text": "And deforestation still happens every day."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:37.895",
    "end": "00:06:39.329",
    "start_seconds": 397.895,
    "end_seconds": 399.329,
    "text": "So how do you stop that?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:40.097",
    "end": "00:06:43.300",
    "start_seconds": 400.097,
    "end_seconds": 403.3,
    "text": "You can't manually patrol that with boots on the ground"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:43.300",
    "end": "00:06:44.935",
    "start_seconds": 403.3,
    "end_seconds": 404.935,
    "text": "and planes and paperwork."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:45.936",
    "end": "00:06:49.673",
    "start_seconds": 405.936,
    "end_seconds": 409.673,
    "text": "So our team worked with local partners and the Brazilian federal police"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:49.706",
    "end": "00:06:53.777",
    "start_seconds": 409.706,
    "end_seconds": 413.777,
    "text": "to create a system that monitors the entire Brazilian Amazon every day."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:54.244",
    "end": "00:06:57.481",
    "start_seconds": 414.244,
    "end_seconds": 417.481,
    "text": "And it looks for a signal of illegal activity."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:57.481",
    "end": "00:06:59.983",
    "start_seconds": 417.481,
    "end_seconds": 419.983,
    "text": "For instance, an unpermitted road."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:00.951",
    "end": "00:07:05.422",
    "start_seconds": 420.951,
    "end_seconds": 425.422,
    "text": "And today, over 100 000 people across the Brazilian government,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:05.456",
    "end": "00:07:07.958",
    "start_seconds": 425.456,
    "end_seconds": 427.958,
    "text": "from a ranger to federal courts,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:07.958",
    "end": "00:07:09.693",
    "start_seconds": 427.958,
    "end_seconds": 429.693,
    "text": "they use this system"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:09.693",
    "end": "00:07:11.628",
    "start_seconds": 429.693,
    "end_seconds": 431.628,
    "text": "and over the last three years,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:11.662",
    "end": "00:07:15.699",
    "start_seconds": 431.662,
    "end_seconds": 435.699,
    "text": "they’ve seized four billion dollars’ worth of illegal equipment in the Amazon."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:15.732",
    "end": "00:07:17.201",
    "start_seconds": 435.73199999999997,
    "end_seconds": 437.201,
    "text": "And most importantly, I think,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:17.234",
    "end": "00:07:20.471",
    "start_seconds": 437.234,
    "end_seconds": 440.471,
    "text": "over wherever this was deployed,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:20.471",
    "end": "00:07:24.074",
    "start_seconds": 440.471,
    "end_seconds": 444.074,
    "text": "deforestation rates decreased by over 50 percent."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:24.541",
    "end": "00:07:29.847",
    "start_seconds": 444.541,
    "end_seconds": 449.847,
    "text": "(Applause)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:29.847",
    "end": "00:07:32.783",
    "start_seconds": 449.847,
    "end_seconds": 452.783,
    "text": "Now let's see what this looks like at the speed of change."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:32.816",
    "end": "00:07:34.218",
    "start_seconds": 452.81600000000003,
    "end_seconds": 454.218,
    "text": "Let's go to Kenya."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:34.251",
    "end": "00:07:38.622",
    "start_seconds": 454.251,
    "end_seconds": 458.622,
    "text": "A herder has kept his cattle on the same semi-arid land"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:38.622",
    "end": "00:07:40.424",
    "start_seconds": 458.622,
    "end_seconds": 460.424,
    "text": "for generations."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:40.457",
    "end": "00:07:43.794",
    "start_seconds": 460.457,
    "end_seconds": 463.794,
    "text": "And livestock to pastoral families is not just their income,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:43.827",
    "end": "00:07:46.363",
    "start_seconds": 463.827,
    "end_seconds": 466.363,
    "text": "it's their savings, their insurance,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:46.396",
    "end": "00:07:48.699",
    "start_seconds": 466.396,
    "end_seconds": 468.699,
    "text": "the accumulated wealth of a lifetime."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:49.199",
    "end": "00:07:51.168",
    "start_seconds": 469.199,
    "end_seconds": 471.168,
    "text": "But every few years, the rains fail."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:51.602",
    "end": "00:07:53.237",
    "start_seconds": 471.602,
    "end_seconds": 473.237,
    "text": "And when they do,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:53.270",
    "end": "00:07:54.738",
    "start_seconds": 473.27,
    "end_seconds": 474.738,
    "text": "the grass dries up,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:54.771",
    "end": "00:07:57.341",
    "start_seconds": 474.771,
    "end_seconds": 477.341,
    "text": "the cattle weaken and they start to die."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:57.641",
    "end": "00:08:01.478",
    "start_seconds": 477.641,
    "end_seconds": 481.478,
    "text": "So one bad drought can wipe out the economic foundation of a family"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:01.512",
    "end": "00:08:02.779",
    "start_seconds": 481.512,
    "end_seconds": 482.779,
    "text": "in a matter of weeks."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:03.447",
    "end": "00:08:06.783",
    "start_seconds": 483.447,
    "end_seconds": 486.783,
    "text": "But now, a new drought insurance program is coming together."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:07.384",
    "end": "00:08:10.320",
    "start_seconds": 487.384,
    "end_seconds": 490.32,
    "text": "The satellite is able to read the health of the grass."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:10.354",
    "end": "00:08:13.090",
    "start_seconds": 490.354,
    "end_seconds": 493.09,
    "text": "If that health falls below a critical threshold,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:13.090",
    "end": "00:08:15.459",
    "start_seconds": 493.09,
    "end_seconds": 495.459,
    "text": "an automatic payment is sent via mobile money"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:15.459",
    "end": "00:08:18.161",
    "start_seconds": 495.459,
    "end_seconds": 498.161,
    "text": "to every pastoralist in the region affected"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:18.161",
    "end": "00:08:21.265",
    "start_seconds": 498.161,
    "end_seconds": 501.265,
    "text": "so that they can go and buy supplemental food for their animals."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:21.765",
    "end": "00:08:24.801",
    "start_seconds": 501.765,
    "end_seconds": 504.801,
    "text": "So the herder doesn't need to understand satellite imagery."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:24.835",
    "end": "00:08:27.104",
    "start_seconds": 504.835,
    "end_seconds": 507.104,
    "text": "He doesn't even need to file a claim."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:28.171",
    "end": "00:08:30.874",
    "start_seconds": 508.171,
    "end_seconds": 510.874,
    "text": "Satellite reads the grass, a number crosses a line,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:30.874",
    "end": "00:08:32.643",
    "start_seconds": 510.874,
    "end_seconds": 512.643,
    "text": "money appears on his phone,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:32.643",
    "end": "00:08:36.079",
    "start_seconds": 512.643,
    "end_seconds": 516.079,
    "text": "he moves his herd, he buys supplemental food,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:36.113",
    "end": "00:08:39.650",
    "start_seconds": 516.113,
    "end_seconds": 519.65,
    "text": "and the crisis that would have unfolded doesn't."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:40.584",
    "end": "00:08:44.254",
    "start_seconds": 520.5840000000001,
    "end_seconds": 524.254,
    "text": "Over a million and a half herders across the Horn of Africa"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:44.288",
    "end": "00:08:47.024",
    "start_seconds": 524.288,
    "end_seconds": 527.024,
    "text": "are now protected with this drought insurance program."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:47.057",
    "end": "00:08:51.695",
    "start_seconds": 527.057,
    "end_seconds": 531.695,
    "text": "(Applause)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:51.728",
    "end": "00:08:53.130",
    "start_seconds": 531.728,
    "end_seconds": 533.13,
    "text": "So this is what it looks like"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:53.130",
    "end": "00:08:56.867",
    "start_seconds": 533.13,
    "end_seconds": 536.867,
    "text": "when you use a signal from space to guide human action"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:57.234",
    "end": "00:08:59.469",
    "start_seconds": 537.234,
    "end_seconds": 539.469,
    "text": "in real time to changing events."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:59.970",
    "end": "00:09:03.707",
    "start_seconds": 539.97,
    "end_seconds": 543.707,
    "text": "The eye detects change and the body moves to prevent harm."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:05.309",
    "end": "00:09:08.412",
    "start_seconds": 545.309,
    "end_seconds": 548.412,
    "text": "And I think there's something deeper going on here."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:09.112",
    "end": "00:09:13.717",
    "start_seconds": 549.112,
    "end_seconds": 553.717,
    "text": "Planetary intelligence doesn't just change what we do,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:13.717",
    "end": "00:09:16.553",
    "start_seconds": 553.717,
    "end_seconds": 556.553,
    "text": "but it changes how we know the world"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:16.587",
    "end": "00:09:18.121",
    "start_seconds": 556.587,
    "end_seconds": 558.121,
    "text": "and our place within it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:19.056",
    "end": "00:09:21.792",
    "start_seconds": 559.056,
    "end_seconds": 561.792,
    "text": "It allows for us to see with the whole in mind."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:22.593",
    "end": "00:09:27.197",
    "start_seconds": 562.593,
    "end_seconds": 567.197,
    "text": "And dissolves the false separation between our culture and our society"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:27.230",
    "end": "00:09:29.333",
    "start_seconds": 567.23,
    "end_seconds": 569.333,
    "text": "and that of the larger living planet."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:30.634",
    "end": "00:09:32.636",
    "start_seconds": 570.634,
    "end_seconds": 572.636,
    "text": "And we're living through a time right now"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:32.669",
    "end": "00:09:35.606",
    "start_seconds": 572.669,
    "end_seconds": 575.606,
    "text": "where many of our institutions and our alliances"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:35.606",
    "end": "00:09:38.041",
    "start_seconds": 575.606,
    "end_seconds": 578.0409999999999,
    "text": "are fracturing and falling apart."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:38.709",
    "end": "00:09:41.845",
    "start_seconds": 578.7090000000001,
    "end_seconds": 581.845,
    "text": "And this is extremely painful"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:41.845",
    "end": "00:09:43.013",
    "start_seconds": 581.845,
    "end_seconds": 583.013,
    "text": "because the problems"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:43.046",
    "end": "00:09:46.183",
    "start_seconds": 583.046,
    "end_seconds": 586.183,
    "text": "that these institutions were built to address"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:46.216",
    "end": "00:09:47.884",
    "start_seconds": 586.216,
    "end_seconds": 587.884,
    "text": "are only intensifying."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:48.218",
    "end": "00:09:50.721",
    "start_seconds": 588.218,
    "end_seconds": 590.721,
    "text": "But I believe that planetary intelligence"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:50.721",
    "end": "00:09:53.724",
    "start_seconds": 590.721,
    "end_seconds": 593.724,
    "text": "can help us transform our institutions."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:54.958",
    "end": "00:09:58.962",
    "start_seconds": 594.958,
    "end_seconds": 598.962,
    "text": "Purpose-built for the speed and the complexity of the 21st century."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:00.097",
    "end": "00:10:03.433",
    "start_seconds": 600.097,
    "end_seconds": 603.433,
    "text": "We can all build new products and institutions"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:03.433",
    "end": "00:10:06.370",
    "start_seconds": 603.433,
    "end_seconds": 606.37,
    "text": "that allow for us to see change in real time."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:06.403",
    "end": "00:10:10.207",
    "start_seconds": 606.403,
    "end_seconds": 610.207,
    "text": "And it can transform just about every sector of our society,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:10.240",
    "end": "00:10:13.410",
    "start_seconds": 610.24,
    "end_seconds": 613.41,
    "text": "from finance to infrastructure,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:13.443",
    "end": "00:10:17.247",
    "start_seconds": 613.443,
    "end_seconds": 617.247,
    "text": "decision-making and accountability mechanisms,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:17.280",
    "end": "00:10:19.383",
    "start_seconds": 617.28,
    "end_seconds": 619.383,
    "text": "all at the speed of change,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:19.383",
    "end": "00:10:22.052",
    "start_seconds": 619.383,
    "end_seconds": 622.052,
    "text": "in order for us to build a more resilient future"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:22.085",
    "end": "00:10:25.989",
    "start_seconds": 622.085,
    "end_seconds": 625.989,
    "text": "so that the next time tanks amass at a border,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:26.023",
    "end": "00:10:28.158",
    "start_seconds": 626.023,
    "end_seconds": 628.158,
    "text": "there will be no pontoon bridge."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:29.526",
    "end": "00:10:33.130",
    "start_seconds": 629.526,
    "end_seconds": 633.13,
    "text": "I started my career believing that information would save us."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:33.830",
    "end": "00:10:37.401",
    "start_seconds": 633.83,
    "end_seconds": 637.401,
    "text": "I now know that only coordination actually will."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:38.669",
    "end": "00:10:40.704",
    "start_seconds": 638.669,
    "end_seconds": 640.704,
    "text": "We gave the earth eyes."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:41.438",
    "end": "00:10:43.407",
    "start_seconds": 641.438,
    "end_seconds": 643.407,
    "text": "We're connecting it to the brain."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:43.807",
    "end": "00:10:48.378",
    "start_seconds": 643.807,
    "end_seconds": 648.378,
    "text": "But now, now the only thing left to do is to build the body,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:48.412",
    "end": "00:10:52.215",
    "start_seconds": 648.412,
    "end_seconds": 652.215,
    "text": "the trust, the alliances, the institutions,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:52.249",
    "end": "00:10:55.218",
    "start_seconds": 652.249,
    "end_seconds": 655.218,
    "text": "that is brave enough to move when the mind signals."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:56.319",
    "end": "00:10:57.554",
    "start_seconds": 656.319,
    "end_seconds": 657.554,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:57.587",
    "end": "00:11:04.461",
    "start_seconds": 657.587,
    "end_seconds": 664.461,
    "text": "(Applause)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:04.494",
    "end": "00:11:07.531",
    "start_seconds": 664.494,
    "end_seconds": 667.531,
    "text": "DS: Thank you so much for watching Robbie’s incredible TED Talk."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:07.564",
    "end": "00:11:09.733",
    "start_seconds": 667.564,
    "end_seconds": 669.733,
    "text": "I'm Divya Siddharth, one of the guest curators"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:09.766",
    "end": "00:11:11.802",
    "start_seconds": 669.766,
    "end_seconds": 671.802,
    "text": "for Robbie’s session this year at TED2026,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:11.802",
    "end": "00:11:13.937",
    "start_seconds": 671.802,
    "end_seconds": 673.937,
    "text": "along with the incredible Audrey Tang."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:14.504",
    "end": "00:11:16.606",
    "start_seconds": 674.504,
    "end_seconds": 676.606,
    "text": "And I think the reason we were so excited"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:16.640",
    "end": "00:11:18.408",
    "start_seconds": 676.64,
    "end_seconds": 678.408,
    "text": "to share Robbie's work with the world"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:18.442",
    "end": "00:11:21.278",
    "start_seconds": 678.442,
    "end_seconds": 681.278,
    "text": "is because we think it's a huge part of what the world needs"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:21.278",
    "end": "00:11:23.980",
    "start_seconds": 681.278,
    "end_seconds": 683.98,
    "text": "to collectively govern and understand our future with AI."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:24.014",
    "end": "00:11:27.084",
    "start_seconds": 684.014,
    "end_seconds": 687.084,
    "text": "One of the reasons this is an important talk to have on stage now"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:27.084",
    "end": "00:11:29.786",
    "start_seconds": 687.084,
    "end_seconds": 689.7860000000001,
    "text": "is information is power."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:29.820",
    "end": "00:11:31.988",
    "start_seconds": 689.82,
    "end_seconds": 691.988,
    "text": "And the incredible thing that Planet has done"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:32.022",
    "end": "00:11:34.491",
    "start_seconds": 692.022,
    "end_seconds": 694.491,
    "text": "is build a very powerful information source"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:34.524",
    "end": "00:11:38.261",
    "start_seconds": 694.524,
    "end_seconds": 698.261,
    "text": "and make it, in as much as they can, available to everyone."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:38.295",
    "end": "00:11:40.363",
    "start_seconds": 698.295,
    "end_seconds": 700.363,
    "text": "And so they not only create the information,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:40.363",
    "end": "00:11:41.598",
    "start_seconds": 700.363,
    "end_seconds": 701.598,
    "text": "which lots of people do,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:41.631",
    "end": "00:11:43.734",
    "start_seconds": 701.631,
    "end_seconds": 703.734,
    "text": "but they actually let people benefit from it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:43.767",
    "end": "00:11:45.936",
    "start_seconds": 703.767,
    "end_seconds": 705.936,
    "text": "And that's, in the age of AI, not always true."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:45.969",
    "end": "00:11:48.872",
    "start_seconds": 705.969,
    "end_seconds": 708.872,
    "text": "Audrey Tang: When you see the Earth from the outer space,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:48.905",
    "end": "00:11:50.474",
    "start_seconds": 708.905,
    "end_seconds": 710.474,
    "text": "we become better people"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:50.507",
    "end": "00:11:55.512",
    "start_seconds": 710.507,
    "end_seconds": 715.512,
    "text": "because we can then imagine that we're on this fragile spaceship."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:55.545",
    "end": "00:11:58.648",
    "start_seconds": 715.545,
    "end_seconds": 718.648,
    "text": "And that really changed me to want to wage peace"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:58.682",
    "end": "00:12:01.685",
    "start_seconds": 718.682,
    "end_seconds": 721.685,
    "text": "much more forcefully than we wage war."
  }
]
